sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Tick as 5s ticker
    participant W as application.Worker
    participant NATS as NATS JetStream
    participant G as delivery goroutine
    participant Ev as Event service
    participant Fx as Effect service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Dest as Effect destination

    Note over W: Run starts publishLoop in a goroutine,<br/>then loops on consumer.Fetch up to 10.

    loop fetch loop until ctx cancelled
        W->>NATS: Fetch(ctx, 10)
        NATS-->>W: deliveries
        W->>G: processDelivery for each delivery, one goroutine each
    end

    G->>G: delivery.Event decodes the envelope
    alt envelope is invalid
        G->>DB: QuarantineEvent source hash and validation class
        G->>NATS: Retry after 5s
    else envelope is valid
        G->>Ev: Process(envelope)
        Ev->>DB: single transaction
        Note over Ev,DB: inbox dedup, active revision, evaluate,<br/>execution, outbox effects, commit
        alt process succeeded
            Ev-->>G: execution
            G->>NATS: Ack only after commit
        else permanent error
            G->>DB: QuarantineEvent
            G->>NATS: Ack
        else retryable error
            G->>NATS: Retry after 5s
        end
    end

    loop publish loop every 5s
        Tick->>Fx: PublishBatch(ctx, 10)
        Fx->>DB: ClaimPending SKIP LOCKED
        DB-->>Fx: claimed effects
        Fx->>Dest: Send each effect
        Dest-->>Fx: accepted or failed
        Fx->>DB: MarkDelivered or ScheduleRetry or Quarantine
    end
